Focus on the exhales, long exhales, don't worry about the inhale, your body will breathe.

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:52.540
So please imagine 
that you have just seen emptiness directly.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.450
And you come out of that direct perception,

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:05.279
and you come back to what we can call normal meditation, which is still not in the world.

