00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:36.500
A very very perfect image of your mom. Living image.
 It actually is your mother.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:40.400
Maybe as you best remember her.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.260
She is looking like that right now.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:51.140
She's gazing at you. 
She's gazing into your eyes.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:58.700
Even though it feels like she's in the front part of your mind, she's looking into your eyes.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:10.260
With great love and also a sense of need. 
